SOURCE OBJECTS
K                 field (usually R or C)
E, F              vector spaces over K
u, v, w           vectors in E
lambda, mu        scalars in K
(e_1,...,e_n)     basis of E
dim E = n
f : E -> F        linear map
A in M_{m,n}(K)   matrix of f in chosen bases
Ker f, Im f       kernel, image
